Z||000009||x-thumpr-x||09-14-2001||11:38 PM||||99.9% of the time strip will be a live wire.<BR>As for brown and blue, go with the blue. Ususally the lightest colour is the live line. <P>electriacian tradesman!!  hehehe||||reg||1
Z||000010||fieronv||09-15-2001||01:03 AM||||brown = ground <BR>blue = hot <BR>European wire<BR> <BR>Electronic tech by trade||||reg||1
